      "edition": "San Bernardino da Siena, Novellette ed esempi morali, a cura di Nazareno Orlandi, Lanciano: R. Carabba, 1916. Italian Wikisource transcription (complete, proofread).",
      "description": "Introduction, the tales in the editor's order, Commiato, Pensieri varii and Bibliografia; frontispiece and index not imported. Retrieved through the MediaWiki parse API.",
      "tier": "A",
      "tierEvidence": "Bernardine died in 1444; the 1916 edition is public domain."
    }
  ],
